id: appmenu-settings-keyboard-down
section: Keyboard and text
item: With the address field focused, open Settings from the app menu: the keyboard goes down and the whole settings page shows
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-chrome-look.md R4
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
chrome address
expect keyboard up 8
sample before-menu 0,30,300,180
chrome appmenu
wait differs 0,30,300,180 before-menu 5
wait still 0,30,300,180 3
chrome appmenu-settings
wait load 30
expect url about:settings
expect keyboard down 8
wait rect page-title 10
expect content 0,100,768,700 page-title Settings
